ring-name><surname>Apekina</surname> <given-names>NS</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Mikhailova</surname> <given-names>TV</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Myasnikov</surname> <given-names>YA</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Khlyap</surname> <given-names>LA</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Korotkov</surname> <given-names>YS</given-names></string-name>, <etal/><article-title>Dynamics of Puumala hantavirus infection in naturally infected bank voles (<italic>Clethrionomys glareolus</italic>).</article-title><source>Arch Virol</source> <year>1999</year>;<volume>144</volume>:<fpage>2415</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>28</lpage> <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s007050050654</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10664394</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R15"><label>15. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Botten</surname> <given-names>J</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Mirowsky</surname> <given-names>K</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Kusewitt</surname> <given-names>D</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Ye</surname> <given-names>C</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Gottlieb</surname> <given-names>K</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Prescott</surname> <given-names>J</given-names></string-name>, <etal/><article-title>Persistent Sin Nombre virus infection in the deer mouse (<italic>Peromyscus maniculatus</italic>) model: sites of replication and strand-specific expression.</article-title><source>J Virol</source> <year>2003</year>;<volume>77</volume>:<fpage>1540</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>50</lpage> <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1128/JVI.77.2.1540-1550.2002</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12502867</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R16"><label>16. </label><citation citation-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Kuenzi</surname> <given-names>AJ</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Douglass</surna